              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Chris Dunlap"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great recipe and this for someone who likes a strong drink. 1oz vermouth will soften it and slightly more than 1oz will be the perfect way your wife will like it. Luxardo cherries are a must. Don’t go too cheap on your rye choice either and a great drink this will be.",
